CRITERION_EVALUATION_PROMPT = """Evaluate each rubric criterion against only the supplied student answer. Return one judgement per criterion with status: satisfied, partially_satisfied, missing, incorrect, or uncertain; evidence; an explanation; and confidence 0..1. Do not output awarded marks or any total. Semantic equivalents count. For satisfied, partially_satisfied, or incorrect, evidence must be an exact short quote copied from the supplied answer. For missing, set evidence exactly to 'No corresponding requirement was located in the submitted answer.' and explain which rubric requirement was checked. If you cannot establish absence from the complete supplied answer, return uncertain. Do not infer missing content from a short excerpt. Follow acceptable alternatives in the rubric."""
